WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.390
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:07.829
No more mocking SCP-008's victims!

00:00:07.829 --> 00:00:11.650
Just because they're zombies doesn't mean
it's okay to bully them.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:16.430
Playing the Michael Jackson song "Thriller"
in the presence of SCP-008 victims is strictly

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:17.430
prohibited.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:22.580
It is also not acceptable to try and simulate
video games using victims of SCP-008.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.670
This includes, but is not limited to, letting
them out of captivity and punching them in

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:31.099
order to "simulate minecraft" (couldn't you
just dig for precious minerals instead?) and

00:00:31.099 --> 00:00:36.450
pushing agents in front of SCP-008 victims
in order to "simulate Resident Evil."

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:40.880
Dr. Bright is no longer allowed within 50
feet of any victims of SCP-008.

